    "group": "Haloscreed Battle Clade",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "In your Movement phase, pick an ADEPTUS MECHANICUS unit. If it has HALO OVERRIDE, it takes D3 mortal wounds and gets one chosen Override ability until your next Command phase begins. This can run alongside existing Overrides, even when the unit was already targeted for one. Without HALO OVERRIDE, give it just the chosen Override until your next Command phase begins.",
